window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Time is running out for Rosanhi and the world she's sworn to protect. As war looms on the horizon, she and Theo must confront their most dangerous adversary yet—the ruthless Ruvyn, whose dark ambitions threaten to unravel not just their future, but time itself.</p> <p>Deeper truths about Rosanhi's mysterious lineage begin to surface, revealing secrets that have been buried for generations. As allies fall and the past collides with the present, Rose must decide if she's willing to sacrifice everything she loves to save everyone she holds dear. </p> <p>In this thrilling conclusion to The Fates Entwined duology, destiny and choice collide in ways no one could have foreseen. Some bonds will strengthen, others will shatter, and not everyone will survive the flames of fate. Rose's journey will push her to limits she never imagined, proving that the most powerful magic often lies in the choices we make and the truths we dare to face. </p> <p>The time has come for Rose to step into her full power—but will it be enough to prevent a future steeped in darkness?</p>"; 
